# Spike 22h demo, played: after the title card, the base becomes group 1;
# an engineer starts a generator (its bar shows progress); the minimap
# jumps the camera across the zone and back; 1 twice brings the group
# back and looks at it; I finds the idle engineer.
at 3.5 drag 450,200 1150,700            # the base
at 3.8 key 1 ctrl                       # group 1
at 4.2 key I                            # an idle engineer
at 4.5 key Z
at 4.7 key W                            # a generator
at 5.0 click 820,600
at 6.5 shot building
at 7.5 click 200,124                    # the minimap: across the zone
at 8.5 shot across
at 9.5 key 1
at 9.6 key 1                            # twice: the group, and the camera on it
at 10.5 shot group
at 10.8 expect selected >= 3
at 11.5 key I
at 12.0 shot idle
at 12.2 expect selected == 1
at 13.0 quit
